{"4974320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A (tiny) Slime Quest", "steam_appid": 4974320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/337216a759579f98f24a286ec2435554.poster.avif?t=1784799375\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/337216a759579f98f24a286ec2435554.webm?t=1784799375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/337216a759579f98f24a286ec2435554.mp4?t=1784799375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A basic RPG Slime in exile</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve been banished from the <strong>Kingdom of Turnabased</strong> after yet another defeat in a world where the respawn rate seems to be regulated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new home—a hidden village and its surroundings—is a <strong>small open area waiting to be explored</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battle scenes here, but <strong>plenty of treasure chests and various secrets</strong> await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/b86da40e2254db9d3f423fb7fb4a8d75.poster.avif?t=1784799375\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/b86da40e2254db9d3f423fb7fb4a8d75.webm?t=1784799375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/b86da40e2254db9d3f423fb7fb4a8d75.mp4?t=1784799375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters with unusual monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other monsters considered useless for battle have been living in the village for a very long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardeners, builders, engineers, and more—you’ll find all kinds! Go meet them and <strong>help them with quests</strong> that even a newbie slime can handle, and <strong>learn new skills</strong> to move around more easily! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll also be able <strong>to trade valuable items</strong> in a side quest that runs throughout the game. Each monster has its own <strong>specific request</strong>, and you’ll be able to carry one item at a time and store another in a dedicated chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/8d9b5252684933b3c3e2a085592b1490.poster.avif?t=1784799375\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/8d9b5252684933b3c3e2a085592b1490.webm?t=1784799375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974320/extras/8d9b5252684933b3c3e2a085592b1490.mp4?t=1784799375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A trial and a destiny in your hands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reasons that led you into exile are full of twists and turns, and the game features multiple possible endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subtle <strong>narrative thread</strong> will lead you to a more substantial challenge as your adventure unfolds: <strong>the dungeon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its <strong>trials</strong> will put your modest new skills to 